   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Participles without the prefix ge-",
     "texto": [
      "Not all German participles start with «ge-». There are two big groups that **never take ge-**:",
      "1) Verbs with **inseparable prefixes** like **be-**, **ver-**, **er-**, **ent-**, **emp-**, **zer-**: besuchen → **besucht**, bezahlen → **bezahlt**, erzählen → **erzählt**, verstehen → **verstanden**.",
      "2) Verbs ending in **-ieren** (most of foreign origin): they form the participle by adding **-t** directly to the stem without «ge-»: reservieren → **reserviert**, fotografieren → **fotografiert**, telefonieren → **telefoniert**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
